Description: error on a review thread page that claims more threads without a cursor
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: no

The review thread walk drives on the endCursor the page parser hands back, and
that parser folded "hasNextPage is true but there is no endCursor" into "there
are no more threads". One such page ended the walk at page one, so every review
thread past it was invisible and an unresolved reviewer comment on page two never
blocked a ready verdict. The parser now raises that page as a query error so the
walk either covers every page or reports that it could not.

